WEBVTT

00:00.720 --> 00:03.520
♪Shrugging off past burdens♪

00:03.520 --> 00:06.110
♪Beneath the mask, who am I?♪

00:06.780 --> 00:10.180
♪Release and find wider shores♪

00:11.880 --> 00:14.890
♪Love's a riddle, and rain pours heavy♪

00:15.260 --> 00:17.790
♪Crossed paths, now downward fall♪

00:18.130 --> 00:21.570
♪From dust arises starlight's spark♪

00:23.320 --> 00:28.540
♪Tearing through
the night's dense blockade♪

00:29.220 --> 00:34.300
♪Heart's flame illuminates all solitude♪

00:35.100 --> 00:37.590
♪Let time's sails drift endlessly♪

00:37.590 --> 00:40.200
♪Through wandering exile♪

00:40.720 --> 00:47.980
♪Breaking free from the cocoon,
I start anew♪

00:48.950 --> 00:51.710
♪Moon as song, life as flame♪

00:51.770 --> 00:54.610
♪Nameless heart clings fiercely♪

00:54.900 --> 00:55.930
♪Let me♪

00:56.120 --> 01:00.200
♪Charge toward the next raging river♪

01:00.650 --> 01:03.330
♪Moon darts, snow falls♪

01:03.620 --> 01:06.320
♪We tread rugged paths to reunite♪

01:06.490 --> 01:07.960
♪Hands held tight♪

01:07.960 --> 01:12.130
♪We forever live for love's sake♪

01:12.490 --> 01:22.740
♪Shadow's spear burns fiercely♪

01:24.170 --> 01:29.720
=Legend of The Female General=

01:29.920 --> 01:32.860
=Episode 34=

01:33.460 --> 01:34.780
Under war's shadow,

01:35.460 --> 01:36.900
people always suffer most.

01:38.300 --> 01:39.460
If peace reigns,

01:40.660 --> 01:42.100
I'd gladly retire.

01:44.100 --> 01:46.020
But I intend to be a great general.

01:46.780 --> 01:47.500
How about this?

01:47.820 --> 01:48.620
I'll support you.

01:50.539 --> 01:51.660
Thank you, General Feihong.

01:54.940 --> 01:56.900
Li Kuang returns to Rundu today.

01:57.180 --> 01:58.340
It should be about time now.

01:58.580 --> 01:59.259
I'll see him off.

01:59.940 --> 02:00.900
Don't you want me to go?

02:01.540 --> 02:02.380
Better not.

02:02.940 --> 02:04.460
Li Kuang got startled

02:04.660 --> 02:05.620
by Mr. Cheng's

02:05.740 --> 02:06.340
grand display.

02:06.500 --> 02:08.139
If not for me,

02:08.419 --> 02:09.940
he'd be long gone.

02:25.570 --> 02:26.850
Send the betrothal certificate?

02:26.980 --> 02:27.870
Give it to me.

02:32.260 --> 02:33.579
Cheng Lisu, hey you!

02:34.420 --> 02:35.100
You have

02:35.100 --> 02:35.740
peanut allergy!

02:36.420 --> 02:37.380
Why eat peanut cakes?

02:38.620 --> 02:40.300
Taotao, I...

02:40.780 --> 02:42.220
You remembered my peanut allergy?

02:42.900 --> 02:44.540
Is this really the time for that?

02:44.620 --> 02:45.300
How much you ate?

02:46.860 --> 02:48.140
I'd rather check your pulse.

02:52.700 --> 02:53.900
Your pulse is steady.

02:54.900 --> 02:55.780
You lie to me?

02:56.020 --> 02:57.380
Taotao, I don't.

02:57.820 --> 02:58.900
You care about me too much.

02:59.340 --> 03:01.380
Yes. I care about you and fall for you.

03:01.460 --> 03:02.060
So what?

03:06.180 --> 03:07.020
Give me the thing.

03:11.740 --> 03:12.620
Why stand up?

03:13.500 --> 03:15.180
Song Taotao, I want to marry you.

03:15.660 --> 03:16.340
I love you.

03:24.460 --> 03:25.220
I, Cheng Lisu, have

03:25.700 --> 03:26.380
fallen for you,

03:26.980 --> 03:27.820
wishing to marry you.

03:28.620 --> 03:29.620
To tie the nuptial knot

03:30.020 --> 03:30.820
and travel together,

03:31.220 --> 03:32.780
writing books and tasting herbs.

03:33.060 --> 03:34.620
I'll only marry you.

03:35.620 --> 03:36.460
What do you think?

03:42.820 --> 03:43.380
I don't want

03:43.380 --> 03:44.500
to tie the nuptial knot.

03:48.100 --> 03:49.260
I'll be lovebirds with you,

03:49.460 --> 03:51.300
so we can travel around.

03:52.860 --> 03:54.700
Right, lovebirds.

04:04.700 --> 04:05.380
Albizia flowers?

04:06.420 --> 04:08.700
They calm the mind and the nerve,

04:09.380 --> 04:10.740
symbolizing marital bliss.

04:29.660 --> 04:30.180
Taotao,

04:33.580 --> 04:34.540
together with you,

04:35.060 --> 04:36.140
I seek no dramatic love.

04:37.020 --> 04:38.140
I only want peace and joy

04:38.580 --> 04:39.420
with you.

04:53.740 --> 04:54.980
It's the wedding invitation

04:54.980 --> 04:55.940
of the Chengs and Songs.

04:56.620 --> 04:57.580
Lisu and Taotao will

04:57.740 --> 04:58.780
marry this month's end.

04:59.380 --> 04:59.980
So fast?

05:00.460 --> 05:01.220
Their families

05:01.220 --> 05:02.300
have done almost

05:02.580 --> 05:03.580
everything of betrothal.

05:03.780 --> 05:04.700
Naturally it is fast.

05:07.100 --> 05:07.900
Finally,

05:08.660 --> 05:09.660
they could be together.

05:12.660 --> 05:13.940
Yes, they are.

05:14.500 --> 05:15.460
Then when will you

05:15.580 --> 05:17.220
and Miss He end up together?

05:34.300 --> 05:36.340
This loquat tree is still here?

05:49.659 --> 05:50.300
So short.

05:55.580 --> 05:56.300
Huaijin.

05:56.980 --> 05:58.100
Must you show off

05:58.100 --> 05:59.060
in front of me,

05:59.380 --> 06:00.740
and then mock my height?

06:04.380 --> 06:05.060
Back then,

06:05.220 --> 06:07.180
you were so cold.

06:07.900 --> 06:09.300
But I'm lucky.

06:09.740 --> 06:10.540
I remember once

06:10.540 --> 06:11.440
when I failed an exam,

06:11.580 --> 06:12.740
I was locked in a dark room.

06:13.460 --> 06:15.060
(I was starving at the time.)

06:15.420 --> 06:15.940
(And then)

06:16.260 --> 06:17.780
(someone secretly gave me loquats.)

06:34.820 --> 06:35.900
I really like

06:36.300 --> 06:37.860
such a kind soul.

06:38.940 --> 06:39.780
You like him

06:40.700 --> 06:41.860
over some loquats?

06:46.780 --> 06:47.740
It's me who gave you

06:48.940 --> 06:49.740
those loquats.

06:55.540 --> 06:57.460
So it was you, Huaijin.

06:58.260 --> 06:59.300
I knew it.

06:59.620 --> 07:00.420
You're the only one

07:00.620 --> 07:02.260
I've ever been so in sync with.

07:02.660 --> 07:05.300
You're truly a lifesaver.

07:07.300 --> 07:08.980
Look at you.

07:09.980 --> 07:11.340
How could you be last again?

07:11.860 --> 07:12.620
Master Wei.

07:12.860 --> 07:14.540
You taught us self-sacrifice.

07:14.900 --> 07:16.700
If I don't endure hardship, who will?

07:16.900 --> 07:17.470
You!

07:18.260 --> 07:20.060
Hopeless.

07:21.680 --> 07:24.130
(Xianchang Academy)

07:27.620 --> 07:28.220
What?

07:28.820 --> 07:30.340
Can't you face me properly?

07:34.500 --> 07:35.380
Xiao Jue.

07:35.620 --> 07:37.300
You are my most proud student.

07:37.900 --> 07:38.980
Why did you...?

07:39.380 --> 07:40.580
Why did he end up liking me?

07:42.700 --> 07:43.659
A woman

07:44.659 --> 07:45.700
disguised as a man

07:45.700 --> 07:46.780
and studied here.

07:47.380 --> 07:48.300
That was outrageous.

07:48.900 --> 07:49.900
You even went

07:50.580 --> 07:51.940
to join the military.

07:53.060 --> 07:54.700
How absurd!

07:54.940 --> 07:55.860
How immoral!

07:56.700 --> 07:57.860
How rude!

07:59.220 --> 08:00.980
Xiao Jue has always
maintained good conduct.

08:01.140 --> 08:02.180
It must be you

08:02.500 --> 08:03.740
who lured him astray.

08:05.500 --> 08:06.140
- Master Wei.
- Master...

08:06.780 --> 08:08.020
I fell for her first.

08:09.180 --> 08:09.940
She is Wei's

08:09.940 --> 08:11.020
first female general.

08:11.380 --> 08:12.140
Frankly speaking,

08:12.740 --> 08:13.540
I'm the lucky one.

08:14.660 --> 08:15.540
You're a grown man.

08:16.020 --> 08:17.980
Don't always talk

08:18.260 --> 08:19.100
about love.

08:20.820 --> 08:22.220
Beauty brings disaster.

08:22.820 --> 08:23.340
So they are

08:23.340 --> 08:24.660
General Feihong and Fengyun?

08:24.660 --> 08:25.380
Yes!

08:25.380 --> 08:26.300
I'll be a general too!

08:26.780 --> 08:28.180
- Me too!
- I'll be a general!

08:28.380 --> 08:28.940
Stop it!

08:29.260 --> 08:30.620
Don't mess around.

08:31.100 --> 08:32.820
Return to your studies!

08:33.059 --> 08:33.980
- Yes.
- Yes.

08:34.419 --> 08:35.820
He's a walking contradiction.

08:36.260 --> 08:37.860
When he heard General Feihong

08:37.860 --> 08:38.780
was a woman,

08:39.140 --> 08:39.860
he angrily removed

08:39.860 --> 08:40.500
the calligraphy

08:40.620 --> 08:41.900
she left during her studies.

08:42.419 --> 08:43.820
But then he still

08:44.140 --> 08:45.060
hung it back up.

08:58.740 --> 08:59.260
Huaijin.

08:59.620 --> 09:00.420
Did you

09:00.620 --> 09:02.060
take me here on purpose?

09:03.340 --> 09:04.900
You're no longer

09:04.900 --> 09:06.420
the problem student,

09:06.980 --> 09:08.420
but the Xianchang Academy's pride.

09:11.740 --> 09:12.340
However,

09:13.180 --> 09:13.900
General Feihong,

09:14.820 --> 09:15.980
to preserve your dignity,

09:16.740 --> 09:18.260
should you study

09:18.740 --> 09:19.620
and retake the exam?

09:22.290 --> 09:27.230
(He Rufei, C)

09:29.020 --> 09:30.820
Retaking the exam for this

09:31.180 --> 09:32.340
would be truly shameful.

09:33.020 --> 09:33.580
Besides,

09:33.900 --> 09:35.660
it's in the long past.

09:36.100 --> 09:37.020
After joining the army,

09:37.140 --> 09:37.980
I kept improving

09:38.420 --> 09:39.780
and became a scholarly general.

09:40.460 --> 09:41.980
I master the classics long ago.

09:42.380 --> 09:43.380
The Virtue chapter?

09:44.060 --> 09:45.900
Unshaken by external things.

09:46.060 --> 09:47.140
How's it, father?

09:47.220 --> 09:48.060
Did I do it well?

09:49.660 --> 09:50.940
Huaijin, if you wish,

09:51.300 --> 09:52.180
I can...

09:52.300 --> 09:53.060
No need.

09:54.540 --> 09:55.580
I mean,

09:56.540 --> 09:58.260
to recite the Virtue chapter again.

09:58.620 --> 09:59.620
What's on your mind?

10:22.260 --> 10:23.380
Lanterns for sale!

10:24.580 --> 10:25.460
Take a look.

10:25.780 --> 10:27.260
Beautiful lanterns!

10:38.020 --> 10:38.700
Lanterns!

10:40.140 --> 10:40.860
Come see!

10:41.060 --> 10:41.900
Lanterns for sale!

10:42.260 --> 10:43.860
All varieties available!

10:47.940 --> 10:48.860
This is my first time

10:48.900 --> 10:50.100
at Yaojing's Lantern Festival.

10:50.340 --> 10:51.380
It's much livelier than

10:51.380 --> 10:52.180
Water God Festival!

10:53.020 --> 10:53.940
Your wish to wander,

10:54.640 --> 10:55.340
my hand to hold.

11:04.500 --> 11:05.180
Sugar figure.

11:05.580 --> 11:06.210
Huaijin.

11:06.300 --> 11:07.140
Want a sugar figure?

11:07.300 --> 11:07.860
Buy you one.

11:09.140 --> 11:09.740
Well,

11:10.260 --> 11:11.500
one with a phoenix?

11:11.860 --> 11:13.300
Or one with a Kylin?

11:15.460 --> 11:16.000
No.

11:16.580 --> 11:17.260
No?

11:17.980 --> 11:18.900
I have money.

11:19.180 --> 11:19.900
I'll buy you one.

11:20.860 --> 11:22.020
No basket-shaped ones here.

11:25.860 --> 11:26.820
You like baskets?

11:27.100 --> 11:28.380
Someone made

11:28.780 --> 11:30.780
a candy basket
for Mr. Chu in Jiyang City?

11:39.580 --> 11:40.740
Are you

11:41.260 --> 11:41.980
feeling jealous?

11:43.980 --> 11:45.260
I never expected

11:45.660 --> 11:47.300
that the mighty General Fengyun

11:47.420 --> 11:48.980
would become so jealous.

11:50.660 --> 11:51.620
I am jealous.

11:52.060 --> 11:53.340
No matter how generous one is,

11:53.700 --> 11:55.140
after falling for someone,

11:55.620 --> 11:56.700
they'd be jealous easily.

11:59.020 --> 11:59.660
Moreover,

12:00.340 --> 12:01.580
he was up to something.

12:03.980 --> 12:04.820
Back then,

12:05.100 --> 12:06.460
he gave me a tassel.

12:07.020 --> 12:07.820
You know

12:07.980 --> 12:09.220
the hardest favors to repay

12:09.340 --> 12:10.260
are kindness.

12:10.860 --> 12:11.500
But

12:11.660 --> 12:12.820
we are different.

12:13.260 --> 12:14.300
We don't need

12:14.460 --> 12:15.500
clear lines.

12:15.860 --> 12:17.380
Just like you,

12:17.700 --> 12:18.620
I'm also unwavering.

12:18.860 --> 12:19.980
I won't love other man.

12:22.180 --> 12:22.820
Come on.

12:23.340 --> 12:23.970
Sir.

12:24.300 --> 12:25.180
One sugar figure.

12:25.460 --> 12:26.500
May I draw it myself?

12:27.260 --> 12:27.900
Of course.

12:28.980 --> 12:29.630
Here.

13:06.780 --> 13:07.330
Done!

13:07.660 --> 13:08.460
You can stop

13:08.740 --> 13:09.780
being jealous.

13:16.500 --> 13:17.260
But

13:17.540 --> 13:19.780
this might be too large.

13:20.380 --> 13:21.380
It's hard to carry.

13:28.620 --> 13:30.140
Don't worry, miss.

13:30.380 --> 13:31.260
We can deliver it

13:31.780 --> 13:33.260
to your mansion.

13:33.900 --> 13:34.420
Really?

13:34.940 --> 13:35.980
Thank you so much.

13:53.420 --> 13:53.940
This one.

13:54.700 --> 13:55.390
How is it?

13:56.740 --> 13:57.900
General Yan.

13:59.580 --> 14:00.420
He Yan.

14:01.580 --> 14:02.540
What a rare sight!

14:02.860 --> 14:03.700
Never expected you

14:03.900 --> 14:05.300
to stroll through night markets.

14:06.460 --> 14:07.100
This must be

14:07.420 --> 14:08.900
you wife, right?

14:08.920 --> 14:09.920
(Xia Chengxiu, Yan He's Wife)

14:10.660 --> 14:11.500
In Rundu,

14:11.900 --> 14:13.780
General Yan mentioned you often.

14:14.180 --> 14:15.060
And this

14:15.540 --> 14:16.580
must be General He.

14:16.940 --> 14:18.340
I've long heard of your fame.

14:20.260 --> 14:22.540
Enough with the formalities.

14:23.060 --> 14:25.380
Xiao Jue, you're here
for the lantern riddles too?

14:25.940 --> 14:26.740
Then go solve

14:26.860 --> 14:27.540
the riddles.

14:28.020 --> 14:30.100
Look how many I've solved already.

14:30.980 --> 14:31.860
He's not solving them,

14:32.140 --> 14:32.860
but

14:33.340 --> 14:35.180
I'll solve one for him.

14:38.260 --> 14:40.540
Xiu, I want you to solve one for me too.

14:41.060 --> 14:41.630
Alright.

14:42.940 --> 14:43.500
Pick one.

14:44.180 --> 14:47.740
(Lantern Riddles)

14:48.540 --> 14:49.340
The blue one then.

14:52.500 --> 14:55.300
This character is remarkable
with four strokes...

14:57.420 --> 14:59.620
Where should I hang this lantern?

15:00.420 --> 15:01.700
What's the perfect spot?

15:02.820 --> 15:03.660
Here then.

15:03.700 --> 15:05.820
Even sages would bow before it.

15:06.100 --> 15:06.780
Wait!

15:08.740 --> 15:12.100
Ten and one at the bottom,
and three on top.

15:13.220 --> 15:13.820
It's "Lei".

15:14.660 --> 15:16.180
Brilliant, miss!

15:17.180 --> 15:18.260
This lantern is yours.

15:19.060 --> 15:19.680
Thank you.

15:24.380 --> 15:24.900
Sir.

15:25.620 --> 15:26.180
Why is

15:26.300 --> 15:27.300
hers nicer than mine?

15:30.340 --> 15:30.860
Sir!

15:53.340 --> 15:54.980
Hungry? Let's get sweet dumplings.

16:01.100 --> 16:01.860
Fans for sale.

16:03.260 --> 16:03.820
Huaijin.

16:04.300 --> 16:05.380
Do you think

16:05.660 --> 16:08.260
we're especially lucky today?

16:12.140 --> 16:12.980
Indeed.

16:25.700 --> 16:26.580
Sweet dumplings!

16:27.260 --> 16:27.980
Let's eat.

16:29.180 --> 16:29.700
Thank you.

16:32.060 --> 16:33.660
You two share one bowl
of sweet dumplings

16:33.860 --> 16:34.940
at the Lantern Festival.

16:35.140 --> 16:37.060
Wish you sweet and blissful,

16:37.500 --> 16:39.620
and be a perfect couple.

16:40.820 --> 16:42.220
Couple?

16:45.140 --> 16:46.100
Us two.

16:49.260 --> 16:50.540
You sweet talker.

17:21.650 --> 17:24.020
(Foguang Temple)

17:38.700 --> 17:40.380
Wait here. I'll give you flowers.

17:42.200 --> 17:44.350
♪Light shines upon my heart♪

17:44.460 --> 17:48.380
♪Unveiling scars,
I choose to swim upstream♪

17:48.550 --> 17:50.500
♪The resonance of courage
rings loud and clear♪

17:50.590 --> 17:53.540
♪It's the boldness
that defines existence♪

17:53.540 --> 17:54.180
You once said

17:56.100 --> 17:57.500
that you walked alone for so long,

17:58.940 --> 17:59.940
yet no one noticed you

18:01.540 --> 18:02.740
or cared about you.

18:04.220 --> 18:05.140
So today,

18:05.540 --> 18:06.740
I've scheduled everything.

18:07.780 --> 18:08.620
I want

18:09.620 --> 18:10.660
to walk through everything

18:12.220 --> 18:13.020
you did with you.

18:13.460 --> 18:15.280
♪Destiny is my creed♪

18:15.500 --> 18:16.180
Therefore,

18:17.340 --> 18:19.380
we revisited Xianchang Academy.

18:20.820 --> 18:22.420
And that one-of-a-kind

18:23.340 --> 18:24.740
lantern commemorating the past.

18:25.810 --> 18:27.860
♪Charge ahead with blazing fervor♪

18:29.000 --> 18:30.830
♪Stubbornly fighting with my life♪

18:32.620 --> 18:33.940
You say the moon guides you,

18:34.460 --> 18:35.060
but you

18:35.060 --> 18:36.380
never need to borrow its light.

18:37.140 --> 18:38.860
Because you can shine brightly

18:39.980 --> 18:41.060
yourself.

18:42.580 --> 18:43.140
He Yan.

18:43.780 --> 18:44.660
I love you.

18:45.940 --> 18:47.580
I wonder if you would like

18:49.140 --> 18:50.690
to marry me.

18:50.800 --> 18:52.690
♪The resonance of courage
rings loud and clear♪

18:52.730 --> 18:56.570
♪It's the boldness
that defines existence♪

18:56.930 --> 18:58.860
♪Chasing the light within my heart♪

19:00.460 --> 19:01.220
What a coincidence.

19:04.140 --> 19:05.340
I've been thinking the same.

19:05.340 --> 19:09.410
♪You'll meet gazes where storms brew♪

19:09.490 --> 19:15.140
♪With our unwavering true love,
brave the world with me♪

19:37.540 --> 19:38.660
I'll be right there with you

19:39.460 --> 19:40.500
through thick and thin.

19:41.420 --> 19:42.580
We'll stick together

19:43.860 --> 19:44.860
until we die.

19:46.240 --> 19:47.710
♪Where is my home♪

19:47.710 --> 19:48.980
♪Smile with tender charm♪

19:49.330 --> 19:51.170
♪Take root and sprout♪

19:52.480 --> 19:53.860
♪Shattered starlight♪

19:53.860 --> 19:55.210
♪Crumbled into dust♪

19:55.500 --> 19:58.130
♪Still gleaming with brilliance♪

19:58.320 --> 20:00.280
♪I your eyes♪

20:01.070 --> 20:03.240
♪My spirit lies♪

20:05.040 --> 20:07.960
♪Soaring across the world's expanse♪

20:08.050 --> 20:10.710
♪There must always be a longing♪

20:11.170 --> 20:16.230
♪Disregard the wounds to seek the light♪

20:16.560 --> 20:18.570
♪Light shines upon my heart♪

20:20.370 --> 20:21.970
Except for sweet dumplings and lanterns,

20:23.100 --> 20:25.820
you even make Feinu
release Kongming lanterns?

20:26.500 --> 20:27.420
How thoughtful.

20:28.880 --> 20:30.820
♪Chasing the light within my heart♪

20:31.010 --> 20:34.830
♪Burying frailty,
embracing life through death♪

20:35.090 --> 20:40.840
♪You'll meet gazes where storms brew♪

20:41.730 --> 20:45.940
♪With our unwavering true love,
brave the world with me♪

20:45.940 --> 20:47.390
(Chu Mansion)

20:50.180 --> 20:51.300
This was a gift from her.

20:52.060 --> 20:52.740
She said,

20:53.740 --> 20:55.180
"Zilan" means nobility and purity.

20:55.820 --> 20:56.780
Only those who love me

20:57.340 --> 20:58.540
would give me such a name.

20:59.580 --> 21:00.540
She gifted this to me.

21:01.100 --> 21:02.140
She must have loved me.

21:11.140 --> 21:11.820
Young Master,

21:11.820 --> 21:12.660
look at this lantern.

21:14.540 --> 21:15.060
Young Master.

21:22.780 --> 21:23.460
(She loves me.)

21:24.260 --> 21:25.340
She loves me.

21:27.020 --> 21:28.140
She must have loved me.

21:30.340 --> 21:31.300
Why did it shatter?

21:31.780 --> 21:32.460
Why?

21:32.900 --> 21:33.500
Why must it be

21:33.500 --> 21:34.740
the very gift from her?

21:34.940 --> 21:35.500
Young Master.

21:36.540 --> 21:37.060
Why?

21:37.500 --> 21:38.140
Why?

21:38.380 --> 21:39.180
Why can't I

21:39.180 --> 21:40.340
ever have anything I desire?

21:43.260 --> 21:43.870
Young Master.

21:44.380 --> 21:44.940
It's fate.

21:45.060 --> 21:45.940
Why force it?

21:49.340 --> 21:49.900
Young Master.

21:50.740 --> 21:51.300
Young Master.

22:08.260 --> 22:09.300
Then you'll draft

22:09.540 --> 22:10.540
the edict.

22:11.300 --> 22:12.100
Understood.

22:17.060 --> 22:18.500
The plum blossoms in the tiny vase

22:19.180 --> 22:20.700
radiate such vibrant fragrance.

22:22.380 --> 22:23.020
Indeed.

22:23.660 --> 22:24.740
This year's plum blooms

22:25.060 --> 22:26.020
are really splendid.

22:27.180 --> 22:28.100
Quite true.

22:28.540 --> 22:29.900
The plum tree south of the city

22:30.100 --> 22:31.020
is also in full bloom.

22:31.740 --> 22:32.300
Yesterday,

22:32.620 --> 22:34.380
General Fengyun went to pluck blossoms

22:34.420 --> 22:35.420
for a young lady.

22:36.500 --> 22:38.260
Xiao Jue?

22:38.820 --> 22:39.980
For which young lady?

22:40.820 --> 22:41.340
She is

22:41.500 --> 22:43.180
no ordinary lady,

22:43.500 --> 22:45.100
but General Feihong.

22:46.220 --> 22:46.820
This

22:46.980 --> 22:48.820
has become a romantic legend.

22:49.500 --> 22:50.940
All agree the two generals

22:50.940 --> 22:52.860
are destined.

22:53.260 --> 22:54.460
Young nobles and ladies

22:54.460 --> 22:55.300
now visit

22:55.460 --> 22:56.900
the plum trees in pairs

22:57.060 --> 22:58.940
to pray for blessings.

23:00.860 --> 23:01.700
Indeed.

23:02.980 --> 23:04.780
Fengyun and Feihong

23:05.180 --> 23:06.740
truly make a peerless pair.

23:07.180 --> 23:08.300
He Yan and Xiao Jue

23:08.540 --> 23:09.740
make a peerless pair.

23:10.380 --> 23:11.660
But General Feihong

23:11.940 --> 23:13.020
and General Fengyun

23:13.700 --> 23:15.140
can't be a good match.

23:16.860 --> 23:17.900
What's different?

23:18.300 --> 23:20.260
General Feihong and Fengyun

23:20.900 --> 23:22.420
hold strong military forces.

23:45.020 --> 23:45.980
It's quite special to be

23:47.060 --> 23:48.020
on the rooftop at night.

23:49.340 --> 23:50.300
When I was young,

23:50.780 --> 23:51.780
before joining the army,

23:52.260 --> 23:53.340
I loved the rooftops.

23:54.140 --> 23:54.940
He Mansion's rooftop

23:55.180 --> 23:56.140
was even higher.

23:56.940 --> 23:58.060
My martial arts were poor.

23:58.460 --> 23:59.980
I could only climb using ladders.

24:00.500 --> 24:01.980
Once when I was halfway up,

24:02.260 --> 24:02.980
I fell down.

24:03.780 --> 24:05.180
Afraid of being noticed,

24:05.340 --> 24:06.180
I didn't shout out.

24:06.460 --> 24:08.060
For a long time after,

24:08.300 --> 24:09.260
my back kept hurting.

24:10.700 --> 24:12.060
Why love being on the rooftops?

24:13.620 --> 24:14.780
Because they are high enough

24:15.580 --> 24:16.540
to reach for the moon

24:17.100 --> 24:18.540
and pluck stars

24:18.940 --> 24:20.100
from the sky.

24:25.380 --> 24:25.980
Childish.

24:27.140 --> 24:28.020
What?

24:28.860 --> 24:30.340
Everyone was so.

24:32.420 --> 24:33.220
If you like it,

24:34.900 --> 24:35.980
every rooftop in my mansion

24:36.500 --> 24:37.100
will be yours.

24:38.060 --> 24:39.300
Even after marriage,

24:39.420 --> 24:39.780
okay?

24:40.180 --> 24:40.700
Okay.

24:41.460 --> 24:42.460
We'll climb together,

24:42.580 --> 24:43.100
okay?

24:43.220 --> 24:43.840
Okay.

24:45.300 --> 24:46.500
If we need to bring snacks...

24:46.500 --> 24:47.420
As long as you like it,

24:48.220 --> 24:48.660
I'm okay.

24:54.580 --> 24:55.100
What's funny?

24:57.860 --> 24:58.700
I was thinking

24:59.260 --> 25:00.780
the mighty General Fengyun

25:01.220 --> 25:02.900
would climb roofs with me.

25:03.700 --> 25:04.220
Moreover,

25:04.740 --> 25:06.260
I regain control of the Fuyue Army.

25:06.700 --> 25:08.260
You and the Xiao Army

25:08.860 --> 25:10.740
might become obsolete.

25:10.940 --> 25:12.100
Nothing keeping you busy?

25:14.620 --> 25:16.100
Such bold words.

25:17.180 --> 25:17.780
It matters not.

25:19.020 --> 25:19.980
Merit determines

25:20.540 --> 25:21.460
position.

25:22.420 --> 25:23.380
I won't show any mercy.

25:24.380 --> 25:25.340
Likewise.

25:27.460 --> 25:28.700
Instead of this talk,

25:29.620 --> 25:30.220
let's discuss

25:31.340 --> 25:32.500
our wedding.

25:33.860 --> 25:34.500
I've hired

25:34.540 --> 25:35.980
Yaojing's best embroiderers

25:36.900 --> 25:38.060
to make the bridal gown.

25:39.100 --> 25:40.060
So soon?

25:41.020 --> 25:41.540
Soon?

25:43.740 --> 25:44.700
I think it's too slow.

25:49.660 --> 25:50.580
Actually,

25:51.140 --> 25:51.940
I feel the same.

26:05.660 --> 26:07.020
I'll measure your shoulders.

26:09.420 --> 26:10.300
Note this down.

26:21.700 --> 26:23.380
Miss, raise your arm.

26:35.100 --> 26:36.260
(You are a woman,)

26:36.940 --> 26:38.500
(yet fight on the battlefields,)

26:39.380 --> 26:40.940
(outshining all men.)

26:42.340 --> 26:43.540
(You deserve)

26:44.700 --> 26:45.900
(the title of)

26:47.140 --> 26:48.260
(General Feihong.)

26:50.580 --> 26:52.100
Why do you keep staring at me?

26:52.980 --> 26:53.500
Beautiful.

26:55.420 --> 26:56.780
You'll look even more stunning

26:56.940 --> 26:57.780
in the wedding dress.

26:58.260 --> 26:59.940
Why am I the only one being measured?

27:00.420 --> 27:00.980
Marriage

27:01.180 --> 27:02.420
is about us two.

27:02.820 --> 27:03.490
Yes.

27:04.060 --> 27:04.740
I need it too.

27:05.340 --> 27:05.980
I want you to.

27:07.660 --> 27:08.300
Me?

27:23.980 --> 27:24.820
Your shoulders

27:25.300 --> 27:26.540
are much broader than mine.

27:27.220 --> 27:27.740
The waist.

27:29.620 --> 27:30.180
Waist?

27:44.660 --> 27:45.620
Measure with hands.

28:31.300 --> 28:32.900
By the imperial decree,

28:33.140 --> 28:35.500
summon General Fengyun Xiao Jue

28:35.580 --> 28:37.500
to the palace.

28:49.780 --> 28:50.340
Your Majesty.

28:51.140 --> 28:52.220
Commander Xiao is here.

28:54.700 --> 28:55.460
I'm Xiao Jue.

28:55.780 --> 28:56.580
Greetings.

28:57.020 --> 28:57.700
Rise.

28:58.420 --> 28:59.500
I summoned you urgently

28:59.780 --> 29:01.300
due to emerging circumstances.

29:02.060 --> 29:02.860
Are the Wutuo people

29:03.500 --> 29:04.380
making any movements?

29:04.900 --> 29:05.500
Exactly.

29:07.820 --> 29:08.940
I got tips from the border.

29:09.700 --> 29:11.180
The Wutuo King had passed away.

29:11.620 --> 29:12.860
His son succeeded the throne.

29:13.380 --> 29:14.540
But his son

29:14.740 --> 29:15.540
is too young.

29:16.300 --> 29:17.300
While his uncle

29:17.860 --> 29:19.100
has strong military forces,

29:19.380 --> 29:20.220
eyeing covetously.

29:20.820 --> 29:21.580
The officials

29:21.940 --> 29:23.180
are divided into two factions.

29:23.700 --> 29:24.940
The Wutuo

29:26.420 --> 29:28.460
could erupt into civil war any moment.

29:29.300 --> 29:30.740
The uncle has accumulated authority.

29:31.540 --> 29:33.540
Usurping the throne
is just a matter of time.

29:34.060 --> 29:35.260
To get more power,

29:35.420 --> 29:36.740
given his warlike nature,

29:37.380 --> 29:38.700
he'll surely invade the Wei.

29:39.940 --> 29:41.900
You are absolutely right.

29:43.020 --> 29:43.740
Therefore,

29:44.300 --> 29:46.140
we shouldn't just watch idly.

29:46.500 --> 29:47.660
Instead, we must prepare

29:47.860 --> 29:48.660
in advance.

29:49.620 --> 29:50.220
I think

29:50.460 --> 29:51.580
we should discuss this with

29:51.700 --> 29:52.740
General Feihong too.

30:02.500 --> 30:04.020
Generals Fengyun and Feihong

30:04.980 --> 30:06.820
are the twin stars of Wei.

30:07.340 --> 30:08.300
With both of you here,

30:08.980 --> 30:11.460
I can rest easy.

30:12.540 --> 30:13.260
I'm flattered.

30:14.060 --> 30:14.860
It's our duty

30:15.500 --> 30:16.860
to protect the nation.

30:17.500 --> 30:18.660
I heard

30:19.100 --> 30:21.420
you gifted plum blossoms to He Yan.

30:24.740 --> 30:25.340
Your Majesty,

30:26.620 --> 30:27.380
He Yan and I

30:28.260 --> 30:29.140
love each other.

30:29.820 --> 30:30.340
We agreed...

30:30.340 --> 30:32.700
Your Majesty,
Mr. Chu Zhao requests audience.

30:36.140 --> 30:36.780
Let him in.

30:37.500 --> 30:38.080
Yes.

30:38.860 --> 30:40.100
By the imperial decree,

30:40.340 --> 30:43.260
summon Mr. Chu Zhao!

30:50.420 --> 30:51.700
- Your Majesty.
- Rise.

30:52.380 --> 30:53.940
What brings you here?

30:54.540 --> 30:55.420
I come here

30:56.260 --> 30:57.500
for personal matters.

31:04.100 --> 31:05.260
Why be so formal?

31:08.300 --> 31:09.900
I've long admired a lady.

31:10.740 --> 31:12.300
I boldly implore you to issue

31:12.740 --> 31:13.660
a marriage decree.

31:14.340 --> 31:15.420
Please grant me.

31:16.580 --> 31:17.740
I see.

31:19.300 --> 31:20.420
Which lady you admire?

31:20.740 --> 31:21.620
Tell me.

31:23.260 --> 31:23.980
He Yan.

31:28.100 --> 31:29.220
You want to marry He Yan?

31:29.780 --> 31:30.860
- Yes.
- No way!

31:41.740 --> 31:42.300
Your Majesty,

31:43.300 --> 31:44.660
He Yan and I are engaged.

31:45.340 --> 31:46.340
And we're about to marry.

31:49.420 --> 31:50.860
Without proper betrothal rites,

31:51.300 --> 31:52.500
can you call it engagement?

31:57.140 --> 31:57.660
Your Majesty,

31:58.740 --> 31:59.860
I love He Yan...

32:00.780 --> 32:01.460
I know.

32:05.420 --> 32:06.180
You and He Yan

32:07.020 --> 32:08.060
can marry.

32:08.860 --> 32:09.540
But

32:10.620 --> 32:13.500
General Fengyun and General Feihong

32:14.700 --> 32:15.460
cannot.

32:19.100 --> 32:19.660
Your Majesty.

32:21.380 --> 32:22.780
I don't want to split lovebirds,

32:23.100 --> 32:24.620
but I have my considerations.

32:25.180 --> 32:27.020
If you insist on marrying He Yan,

32:27.500 --> 32:28.260
I won't stop you.

32:28.900 --> 32:29.900
But one of you

32:31.540 --> 32:33.060
must surrender

32:34.740 --> 32:36.180
your military authority.

33:01.300 --> 33:01.900
Commander Xiao,

33:02.980 --> 33:03.980
you fought so hard

33:04.100 --> 33:05.740
to clear your father's name.

33:06.020 --> 33:06.740
And the Xiao Army

33:07.180 --> 33:08.420
barely regained

33:08.580 --> 33:09.420
morale.

33:09.740 --> 33:10.420
No one else

33:10.780 --> 33:11.980
can command them.

33:26.380 --> 33:27.980
Think it over.

33:28.900 --> 33:29.500
Tomorrow,

33:30.910 --> 33:31.780
tell me your answer.

33:38.700 --> 33:39.260
Besides,

33:40.260 --> 33:41.740
no outsiders shall know

33:42.220 --> 33:43.660
about this matter.

33:44.900 --> 33:45.700
Understood.

34:19.179 --> 34:19.860
I admit.

34:21.100 --> 34:22.219
I'm trying to

34:22.380 --> 34:23.260
steal He Yan from you.

34:23.900 --> 34:24.860
But concentrating

34:24.860 --> 34:26.420
military power has been taboo.

34:28.179 --> 34:29.060
He Yan suffered

34:29.060 --> 34:29.980
so much pain

34:29.980 --> 34:30.900
to reclaim her identity

34:31.659 --> 34:32.420
as General Feihong.

34:33.780 --> 34:35.060
Can you watch her give up

34:35.780 --> 34:36.580
everything for you?

34:37.540 --> 34:38.580
And how could you

34:38.940 --> 34:39.860
betray your late father

34:40.500 --> 34:41.820
and abandon the Xiao Army

34:41.900 --> 34:42.980
he entrusted to you?

34:47.980 --> 34:48.620
Xiao Jue,

34:49.340 --> 34:50.179
just admit it.

34:51.219 --> 34:51.780
You

34:52.219 --> 34:54.340
and He Yan aren't destined.

34:55.179 --> 34:56.179
You and her

34:57.060 --> 34:58.100
cannot be together.

35:42.580 --> 35:43.660
What took you so long?

35:43.980 --> 35:45.060
What did His Majesty say?

35:46.060 --> 35:47.500
The Wutuo King suddenly passed away,

35:48.160 --> 35:49.260
succeeded by his young son.

35:49.820 --> 35:50.660
Wutuo King's brother

35:51.020 --> 35:52.460
is eyeing the throne for usurpation.

35:53.420 --> 35:54.220
His Majesty fears

35:54.660 --> 35:55.700
the Wutuo's civil war

35:56.340 --> 35:57.740
will endanger

35:57.740 --> 35:58.700
the Wei.

35:59.220 --> 35:59.740
Therefore,

36:00.700 --> 36:01.860
we must prepare in advance.

36:03.740 --> 36:04.300
True.

36:04.780 --> 36:06.380
We need to stay alert

36:06.780 --> 36:08.180
of the cunning Wutuo people.

36:09.700 --> 36:10.460
But,

36:11.380 --> 36:12.500
for such crucial matters,

36:12.980 --> 36:13.500
why did

36:13.860 --> 36:15.580
His Majesty only summon you?

36:25.140 --> 36:25.740
Next time,

36:27.280 --> 36:28.380
His Majesty will summon you

36:28.980 --> 36:30.140
to discuss this.

36:32.260 --> 36:33.260
Excellent.

36:37.820 --> 36:39.140
As the General Feihong,

36:39.980 --> 36:41.300
you must soar freely

36:42.740 --> 36:43.820
in the sky.

37:35.420 --> 37:35.940
Young Master,

37:36.380 --> 37:37.340
eat something.

37:37.660 --> 37:38.260
I'm not hungry.

37:38.900 --> 37:39.700
Leave now.

37:44.020 --> 37:45.780
If you've made up your mind,

37:46.340 --> 37:47.620
why being so troubled?

37:52.180 --> 37:53.220
I am troubled?

37:56.860 --> 37:58.540
Having served you for so long,

38:00.020 --> 38:01.180
I can tell

38:02.100 --> 38:03.340
you're troubled.

38:09.020 --> 38:10.060
You resemble

38:11.220 --> 38:12.180
glacial ice,

38:12.900 --> 38:13.900
crystal clear,

38:14.300 --> 38:15.180
yet chillingly cold.

38:16.380 --> 38:17.420
Miss He

38:19.740 --> 38:20.780
resembles fire,

38:22.060 --> 38:22.980
shining brightly,

38:24.620 --> 38:25.740
yet scorching

38:26.740 --> 38:27.860
when you get close.

38:29.660 --> 38:30.500
Today, you've spoken

38:31.940 --> 38:32.700
too much.

38:37.060 --> 38:38.020
I'm sorry.

38:39.540 --> 38:40.500
Please eat.

38:53.420 --> 38:55.180
Ice and fire cannot be together.

39:03.380 --> 39:04.740
So what?

39:08.340 --> 39:12.320
(Virtues' Enduring Legacy)

39:20.020 --> 39:23.260
(Late Father Xiao Zhongwu,
Late Mother Song Wan)

39:24.820 --> 39:25.780
(Constant effort)

39:26.060 --> 39:27.060
(brings success.)

39:27.940 --> 39:28.700
(Someday,)

39:29.180 --> 39:30.340
(you two will become)

39:30.380 --> 39:31.460
(Wei's Twin Stars.)

39:31.940 --> 39:32.820
(Work together.)

39:33.320 --> 39:34.020
(Wielding swords)

39:34.300 --> 39:35.100
(to guard the land)

39:35.820 --> 39:36.660
(and our people.)

39:37.940 --> 39:38.860
(I believe I was born)

39:38.860 --> 39:39.900
to be a general.

39:40.660 --> 39:42.020
Sometimes, I even feel

39:42.660 --> 39:44.340
I was a female general in my past life.

39:45.300 --> 39:47.020
Impressive, right?

39:48.100 --> 39:49.660
You know why I let you lead them?

39:50.060 --> 39:50.620
Because

39:51.980 --> 39:53.380
I'm unquestionably capable.

39:54.560 --> 39:58.300
♪Before destiny is sealed♪

39:58.300 --> 40:00.220
(Xiao Zhongwu, Song Wan)
Father, Mother.

40:01.700 --> 40:03.540
I cannot abandon the Xiao Army.

40:05.220 --> 40:06.900
Nor can I be her obstacle.

40:09.420 --> 40:11.860
If we're not destined to be a couple...

40:11.860 --> 40:14.830
♪That's my last wish♪

40:15.460 --> 40:16.420
Then I'd rather be

40:18.060 --> 40:19.180
single and alone.

40:23.620 --> 40:25.780
♪Light shines upon my heart♪

40:25.880 --> 40:29.800
♪Unveiling scars,
I choose to swim upstream♪

40:29.980 --> 40:31.920
♪The resonance of courage
rings loud and clear♪

40:32.020 --> 40:36.950
♪It's the boldness
that defines existence♪

40:49.040 --> 40:50.450
♪I've seen the mountains♪

40:50.650 --> 40:52.070
♪And trodden through ice♪

40:52.330 --> 40:55.150
♪Day after day, I venture alone♪

40:55.450 --> 40:56.850
♪Destiny is my creed♪

40:56.900 --> 40:58.300
♪Ideals surge beneath the surface♪

40:58.450 --> 41:00.250
♪Igniting the flame against the winds♪

41:01.450 --> 41:02.920
♪A restless yearning in my soul♪

41:03.090 --> 41:04.370
♪Gazing through the mire♪

41:04.550 --> 41:06.940
♪Who cares about this boundless void♪

41:07.140 --> 41:09.190
♪Charge ahead with blazing fervor♪

41:10.330 --> 41:12.160
♪Stubbornly fighting with my life♪

41:14.120 --> 41:17.040
♪Soaring across the world's expanse♪

41:17.130 --> 41:19.790
♪There must always be a longing♪

41:20.240 --> 41:25.310
♪Disregard the wounds to seek the light♪

41:25.640 --> 41:27.650
♪Light shines upon my heart♪

41:27.960 --> 41:31.610
♪Unveiling scars,
I choose to swim upstream♪

41:31.840 --> 41:33.730
♪The resonance of courage
rings loud and clear♪

41:33.770 --> 41:37.610
♪It's the boldness
that defines existence♪

41:37.960 --> 41:39.900
♪Chasing the light within my heart♪

41:40.090 --> 41:43.910
♪Burying frailty,
embracing life through death♪

41:44.170 --> 41:49.920
♪You'll meet gazes where storms brew♪

41:50.810 --> 41:56.280
♪With our unwavering true love,
brave the world with me♪

42:03.430 --> 42:06.350
♪Soaring across the world's expanse♪

42:06.440 --> 42:09.100
♪There must always be a longing♪

42:09.550 --> 42:14.620
♪Disregard the wounds to seek the light♪

42:14.950 --> 42:16.960
♪Light shines upon my heart♪

42:17.270 --> 42:20.920
♪Unveiling scars,
I choose to swim upstream♪

42:21.160 --> 42:23.050
♪The resonance of courage
rings loud and clear♪

42:23.080 --> 42:26.930
♪It's the boldness
that defines existence♪

42:27.280 --> 42:29.220
♪Chasing the light within my heart♪

42:29.400 --> 42:33.230
♪Burying frailty,
embracing life through death♪

42:33.480 --> 42:39.230
♪You'll meet gazes where storms brew♪

42:40.120 --> 42:45.590
♪With our unwavering true love,
brave the world with me♪
